OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Sunday to Tuesday:FCold
OL,6,Fwith sunny spells and isolated coastal
OL,7,Fshowers on Sunday. Cold but sunny on
OL,8,FMonday. Cloudier and breezier by
OL,9,FTuesday, with outbreaks of rain,
OL,10,Fturning to snow over the Pennines.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
